    {
      "text": "Am I my brother’s keeper, Gen. 4:9 (Moses 5:34). Abram took … Lot his brother’s son, Gen. 12:5. He is my brother, Gen. 20:5. Nahor, Abraham’s brother, Gen. 22:23. shalt serve thy brother, Gen. 27:40. Ye shall not see my face, except your brother be with you, Gen. 43:5 (44:23). perform the duty of an husband’s brother unto her, Deut. 25:5. slothful … is brother to him that is a great waster, Prov. 18:9. no man shall spare his brother, Isa. 9:19. trust ye not in any brother, Jer. 9:4. every man’s sword shall be against his brother, Ezek. 38:21. they hunt every man his brother, Micah 7:2. Was not Esau Jacob’s brother, Mal. 1:2.",
