    {
      "text": "angry with his brother without a cause, Matt. 5:22 (3 Ne. 12:22). the brother shall deliver up the brother, Matt. 10:21 (Mark 13:12). brother shall trespass against thee, Matt. 18:15. how oft shall my brother sin against me, Matt. 18:21. brother shall marry his wife, Matt. 22:24 (Mark 12:19; Luke 20:28). Is not this … the brother of James, Mark 6:3. thy brother was dead, and is alive, Luke 15:32. thou judge thy brother? … set at nought thy brother, Rom. 14:10. nor any thing whereby thy brother stumbleth, Rom. 14:21. brother goeth to law with brother, 1 Cor. 6:6. through thy knowledge shall the weak brother perish, 1 Cor. 8:11. James the Lord’s brother, Gal. 1:19. not of God, neither he that loveth not his brother, 1 Jn. 3:10. seeth his brother have need, and shutteth up, 1 Jn. 3:17.",
